d-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic001269.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo L. Campagna 2005-03-31\" src=\"ISic001269-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text of IG 14.0444\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"7\">7: \u003Cspan>Ferrua 1982 and 1989: corrects Γ to Ε\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>Ferrua notes that the date must be corrected, if it is to align with the consulship year of 409. Note the day recorded as day of the moon; and note the combined use of Greek and Latin abbreviations for Augustus, the latter in Greek letters. \u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Kaibel 1890 \u003Ca href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">444\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Rizzo 1904 114 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10003144\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10003144\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Ferrua 1982-1983 12 no.35 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001996\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001996\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1986 36.0887 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Ferrua 1989 no.483 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.ins